  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 1503.18 Woody Tailings from Compost Screening Activities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 1503.18 Woody Tailings from Compost Screening Activities. Clean woody particles resulting from screening of finished compost shall be certified for distribution and use as:\n\n(a) A mulch product;\n\n(b) A bulking agent for composting; and\n\n(c) An odor filtration medium for use with composting systems.\n\nSource. #13358, eff 4-1-22; ss by #14067, eff 9-3-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw1500.html"
